            "title": "Diagnose Mixed Inputs",
            "id": 152103,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A primeira operação converte <code>\"free\"</code> em um número. Qual manipulador corresponde a essa falha?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;free&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"price = float(price_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quantity = order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"share = total / quantity\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except ValueError:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except KeyError:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ZeroDivisionError:</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>except TypeError:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except ValueError:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Complete Three Handlers",
            "id": 152104,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conclua o terceiro manipulador para adicionar a taxa de texto <code>\"2\"</code> ao preço numérico.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"record.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = float(record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = price + \" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Price failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Read failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use compatible values&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"231\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Use compatible values\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>TypeError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Preserve Handler Order",
            "id": 152105,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é verdade sobre este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")`\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Diferentes tipos de erros podem ser tratados de maneiras diferentes</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O <code>except</code> sem exceções é executado após qualquer erro</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Somente o primeiro <code>except</code> pode ser executado</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>ValueError</code> e <code>KeyError</code> imprimem <em>Other</em></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Diferentes tipos de erros podem ser tratados de maneiras diferentes.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Preserve Exception Details",
            "id": 152106,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Capture a exceção de chave ausente na variável <code>error</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ira&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(error)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"details\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"'role'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>except</code> seguido de <code>KeyError</code> e depois <code>as</code>, <code>error</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Build a Context Message",
            "id": 152107,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a f-string com os detalhes da exceção capturada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(quantity_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;Quantity failed: \" /><text value=\"{error}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"119\" endIndex=\"126\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Quantity failed: invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'many'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{error}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Repair the Price Import",
            "id": 152108,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "Substitua o manipulador genérico por manipuladores separados para um preço inválido (`ValueError`) e uma quantidade de itens igual a zero (`ZeroDivisionError`). Exiba mensagens de erro apropriadas em ambos os blocos `except`.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": false,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "script.py",
                  "codeLanguage": "python",
                  "content": "price_text = \"free\"\nitems = 2\n\ntry:\n price = float(price_text)\n share = price / items\nexcept:\n  print(\"Import failed\")\n",
                  "solvedContent": "price_text = \"free\"\nitems = 2\n\ntry:\n price = float(price_text)\n share = price / items\nexcept ValueError:\n  print(\"Enter a numeric price\")\nexcept ZeroDivisionError:\n  print(\"Add at least one item\")\n"
                }
              ],
              "hints": []
            }
